# Separation logic

{pause}
## Hoare logic + pointers

{pause}
[Hoare logic](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hoare_logic) makes it possible to verify
the correctness of imperative programs.

{pause up}
### A Hoare logic example

{carousel change-page=~n:all}
> ```ada
> …
>    X : Integer := Foo (…);
>    Y : Integer := Bar (…);
> begin
>    declare
>       Tmp : Integer;
>    begin
>       Tmp := X;
>       X := Y;
>       Y := Tmp;
>    end;
> …
> ```
>
> ```ada
> …
>    X : Integer := Foo (…);
>    Y : Integer := Bar (…);
>
>    X0 : constant Integer := X with Ghost;
>    Y0 : constant Integer := Y with Ghost;
> begin
>    declare
>       Tmp : Integer;
>    begin
>       Tmp := X;
>       X := Y;
>       Y := Tmp;
>    end;
>
>    pragma Assert (X = Y0);
>    pragma Assert (Y = X0);
> …
> ```

